# Keep this folder in Git.

place/WorkshopZeroPrototype.rbxlx is the Studio-owned working place:

    Workshop geometry
    Lighting
    Imported meshes
    Manual layout
    Future challenge geometry

Rules:
  - scripts/build.ps1 creates build/WorkshopZero.rbxlx and NEVER overwrites
    the place file after the first seed.
  - Rojo syncs managed code into this place during development.
  - Do not use Roblox Studio Script Sync at the same time as Rojo.
